------------- | ------- | ----------------------- |\n| Coverage | same tests, V8 coverage | Vitest  | `npm run test:coverage` |"],[360,"| Layer | Where                     | Runs in                                        | Command    |\n| ----- | ------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | ---------- |\n| Unit  | `apps/web/test/*.test.ts` | Vitest, Node (happy-dom per file where needed) | `npm test` |"],[165,"| Metric                                           | Before  | After                                          |\n| ------------------------------------------------ | ------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| Big capture: full frame cost (render + GPU sync) | 3776 ms | 2978–3038 ms (no shadow pass on camera frames) |"],[164,"| Metric                                      | Before | After    |\n| ------------------------------------------- | ------ | -------- |\n| Big capture: pin update per frame (50 pins) | 873 ms | **2 ms** |"],[160,"| Metric                                  | Before            | After               |\n| --------------------------------------- | ----------------- | ------------------- |\n| Big capture: vertices / geometry memory | 2,916,000 / 89 MB | **490,148 / 26 MB** |"],[166,"| Metric                                  | Before  | After                                                        |\n| --------------------------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Big capture: first frame with the model | 3357 ms | 2466–4113 ms (noise; adds weld, BVH moved after first frame) |"],[159,"| Metric                                  | Before | After |\n| --------------------------------------- | ------ | ----- |\n| Demo with 50 pins, idle: renders in 3 s | 5      | **0** |"],[158,"| Metric                           | Before          | After |\n| -------------------------------- | --------------- | ----- |\n| Demo, idle stage: renders in 3 s | 8 (every frame) | **0** |"],[161,"| Metric                          | Before | After          |\n| ------------------------------- | ------ | -------------- |\n| Big capture: JS heap after load | 271 MB | **104–123 MB** |"],[163,"| Metric                          | Before | After       |\n| ------------------------------- | ------ | ----------- |\n| Big capture: one `isOccluded()` | 221 ms | **0.02 ms** |"],[162,"| Metric                    | Before | After       |\n| ------------------------- | ------ | ----------- |\n| Big capture: one `pick()` | 179 ms | **0.07 ms** |"],[195,"| Option                                                                                                                     | Input               | Runs on                        | Thin parts | Gloss  | Output           | Cost                                                                                                                                                                                                       | Verdict                                                          |\n| -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------------ | ---------- | ------ | ---------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Cloud photogrammetry APIs**: KIRI Engine API (photo scan + 3DGS), Luma API, Polycam, RealityCapture / RealityScan (Epic) | Upload photos/video | Vendor cloud / Windows desktop | Varies     | Varies | GLB/OBJ/USDZ/PLY | Per-scan credits or seat plans. verify: current price per model, upload limits (images, video length, resolution), commercial-use and data-retention terms, whether customer photos may train their models | Good for \"no Mac, no GPU\"; needs account + budget + terms review |"],[194,"| Option                                                                                                           | Input                                    | Runs on                                                                                    | Thin parts                               | Gloss                           | Output                                | Cost                           | Verdict                                                       |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Gaussian splatting** (nerfstudio `splatfacto`, gsplat, Postshot; apps: Polycam, Luma, Scaniverse, KIRI Engine) | Video or images, plus SfM poses (COLMAP) | NVIDIA GPU for training (minutes); phone apps do it in the cloud or on device (Scaniverse) | **Good** (looks right, not a clean mesh) | **Good** (view-dependent color) | `.ply` / `.spz` splats; no clean mesh | Free (open source) / app plans | **Photoreal option**: needs splat viewer support (ROADMAP M6) |"],[196,"| Option                                                                              | Input      | Runs on                   | Thin parts           | Gloss   | Output | Cost                | Verdict                                                                                                                        |\n| ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------- | ------------------------- | -------------------- | ------- | ------ | ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **AI image-to-3D**: TRELLIS (Microsoft, MIT), Hunyuan3D 2.x (Tencent), Tripo, Meshy | 1–4 photos | GPU (open models) or SaaS | **Invents** geometry | Invents | GLB    | Free / SaaS credits | Not for a sales model of *this* bike. OK for placeholders, catalog thumbnails or \"illustrative\" models clearly labeled as such |"],[192,"| Option                                                                | Input                        | Runs on                                                                                                                                             | Thin parts   | Gloss | Output                                                      | Cost                          | Verdict                              |\n| --------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------ | ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| **COLMAP** (SfM + MVS) + **OpenMVS** (densify, mesh, refine, texture) | Any images; video via frames | Linux/macOS/Windows; Docker; SfM fine on CPU; COLMAP dense *needs* CUDA, OpenMVS dense runs on CPU (slow: tens of minutes to hours for 150 × 12 MP) | Poor to fair | Poor  | PLY/OBJ + texture; camera poses (`cameras/images/points3D`) | Free (BSD / AGPL for OpenMVS) | **Fallback** (Linux, server, no Mac) |"],[191,"| Option                                                         | Input                                                                                   | Runs on                                                                                                     | Thin parts                     | Gloss | Output                                                                                     | Cost            | Verdict     |\n| -------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | --------------- | ----------- |\n| **Apple Object Capture** (`PhotogrammetrySession`, RealityKit) | Any folder of JPEG/HEIC/PNG (not only iPhone photos); depth and gravity help if present | macOS 12+ (detail levels `.reduced` … `.raw`; Apple silicon or a Mac with a capable GPU), iOS 17+ on device | Fair; better with close passes | Fair  | USDZ (textured), poses via `.poses` request (macOS 14 / iOS 17+), automatic object masking | Free with a Mac | **Default** |"],[193,"| Option                     | Input  | Runs on                                   | Thin parts   | Gloss | Output        | Cost        | Verdict                                          |\n| -------------------------- | ------ | ----------------------------------------- | ------------ | ----- | ------------- | ----------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Meshroom / AliceVision** | Images | Linux/Windows, CUDA needed for depth maps | Poor to fair | Poor  | OBJ + texture | Free (MPL2) | Worse than COLMAP + OpenMVS for automation; skip |"],[54,"| Path                 | Content      |\n| -------------------- | ------------ |\n| `model.glb\\|usdz\\|…` | the 3D model |"],[52,"| Path              | Content                                                                 |\n| ----------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `bike-share.json` | `{ schema: \"bike-share/1\", id, name, createdAt, scene, model,